WEBVTT

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:15.990
One hundred years have passed
since the Battle of Galluah Plains,

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:19.490
where King Kyle defeated
the Dark Lord Angmund.

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:21.790
The Demons rise again,
threatening the world,

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:25.290
spreading fear and unrest to all.

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:30.660
Kasel is told that he is the son of King Kyle.

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:35.910
He seeks to find and acquire the Holy Sword Aea,
to protect those dear to him.

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:40.160
He departs on a journey to find
the keys to unseal the Holy Sword.

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:44.740
In order to acquire the Holy Sword,
you must first break its seal.

00:00:44.740 --> 00:00:50.200
First, go meet Lorraine,
the Grand Sage of the Forest of Elidora.

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:51.870
Let's go.

00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:26.910
<i></i>The Forest and

00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:26.910
<i></i>the Elves

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:43.410
That's the Forest of Elidora.

00:02:43.410 --> 00:02:46.290
Ugh, a forest.

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:49.660
And here I thought I'd get to go
to lots of interesting places!

00:02:49.660 --> 00:02:54.040
Well, um, the Forest of Elidora isn't
some place you can enter usually, so...

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:56.200
It's still a forest.

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:57.620
Anyway...

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:03.290
Kasel is the son of King Kyle?

00:03:03.290 --> 00:03:05.700
I don't buy that at all!

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:07.490
How about you?

00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:10.080
Do you, like, have a gut feeling or something?

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:11.080
Huh?

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:13.790
No, I...

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:16.290
The legendary King Kyle, my father?

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:18.450
No...

00:03:18.450 --> 00:03:24.370
I know right? I mean, it's King Kyle,
legendary hero, slayer of the Dark Lord.

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:28.700
Meanwhile, you, heroic? Not one bit.

00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:31.040
Hey, you...

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:34.790
I... believe.

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:38.290
I believe we are being guided
by Lua, our goddess.

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:39.330
Frey...

00:03:43.330 --> 00:03:45.160
Hey, what's this?

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:46.540
Here they come.

00:03:51.990 --> 00:03:53.240
Demons...!

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:55.160
Roi!

00:03:55.160 --> 00:03:56.620
We have to go, too!

00:03:57.290 --> 00:03:58.700
It's fine.

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:11.580
Incredible.

00:04:14.330 --> 00:04:15.620
Dammit.

00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:19.200
More?

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:36.740
Um!

00:04:36.740 --> 00:04:41.660
Thank you for saving us. I'm Kasel.

00:04:41.660 --> 00:04:43.200
I'm Cleo.

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:44.450
My name is Frey.

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:48.620
A great sorceress from the Tower of the Sage!

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:52.410
I didn't think it was possible to see Demons
so close to the Forest of Elidora...

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:56.330
They have recently started
to appear quite frequently.

00:04:56.330 --> 00:04:58.410
I see.

00:04:58.410 --> 00:05:00.620
I was waiting for you.

00:05:00.620 --> 00:05:03.370
I will guide you to Master Lorraine.

00:05:03.370 --> 00:05:05.540
What?!

00:05:05.540 --> 00:05:07.660
Hey, is this...

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:09.910
Um...

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:12.160
Let's follow along, for now.

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:13.580
I guess.

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:26.200
This is...

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:27.830
...the Forest of Elidora...

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:40.240
Is that...

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:41.490
A treant!

00:05:41.490 --> 00:05:44.450
I've never seen them so close up...!

00:05:44.450 --> 00:05:47.450
Um... Who are you?

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:50.200
And where is Lorraine,
the Great Sage of the Forest?

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:51.910
It's "Master" Lorraine.

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:54.040
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:57.660
But anyway, who are you?

00:05:57.660 --> 00:06:00.290
You didn't even introduce yourself,
and you're all like, "Follow me."

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:03.080
Kind of rude, don't you think?

00:06:03.080 --> 00:06:04.700
I am Selene.

00:06:04.700 --> 00:06:09.540
Master Lorraine instructed me
to bring to her the human, Kasel.

00:06:09.540 --> 00:06:11.160
And us?

00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:14.830
What about us?

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:20.080
I am only following
Master Lorraine's wishes.

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:22.200
Um...

00:06:22.200 --> 00:06:23.620
We must hurry.

00:06:44.050 --> 00:06:45.290
What's wrong, Roi?

00:06:45.290 --> 00:06:49.040
I keep getting the feeling that
I'm being looked at.

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:52.790
Yeah, or more like stared or gawked at.

00:06:52.790 --> 00:06:56.490
--Humans...
--Why did the Princess...?
--A blight on the forest.

00:06:56.490 --> 00:06:59.580
--Go away.
--This is no place for you.

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:01.790
Did the Princess bring them?

00:07:01.790 --> 00:07:03.700
Stay away.

00:07:01.790 --> 00:07:03.700
Princess...?

00:07:03.700 --> 00:07:07.870
Leave.

00:07:03.700 --> 00:07:07.870
I heard that, too! Are you the princess?

00:07:07.870 --> 00:07:09.200
Yes.

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:11.620
Ah, so you're a princess!

00:07:11.620 --> 00:07:13.580
Lowly humans...

00:07:13.580 --> 00:07:17.240
--How vile.
--Useless.
--Such a travesty.

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:23.490
--Who'd have thought we'd have to see one?
--Leave as soon as possible.

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:23.490
Hey, if you've got something to say,
come out and say it to my face!

00:07:23.490 --> 00:07:25.040
Leave this place.

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:28.490
We're not exactly on
a sightseeing tour either, you know!

00:07:28.490 --> 00:07:32.240
It doesn't seem like we're welcome here.

00:07:32.240 --> 00:07:37.290
Isn't it obvious?
This forest is sacred to us elves.

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:41.200
Why must we welcome you humans?

00:07:41.200 --> 00:07:42.990
That's not nice.

00:07:42.990 --> 00:07:46.870
We're the outsiders here.

00:07:46.870 --> 00:07:49.540
We have no quarrel with the elves.

00:07:49.540 --> 00:07:52.040
Let's get to Master Lorraine quickly.

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:03.950
Huh?

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:05.410
Where's Miss Selene?

00:08:05.410 --> 00:08:07.830
She was just here a moment ago...

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:10.040
We have to catch up to her quickly.

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:27.080
It's a dead end!

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:29.740
What?!

00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:31.620
By the way...

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:35.330
Do you know the other name
for the Forest of Elidora?

00:08:35.330 --> 00:08:36.410
No.

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:37.790
Forest of the Lost.

00:08:37.790 --> 00:08:42.450
The elves and treants play tricks
on travelers to make them lose their way.

00:08:42.450 --> 00:08:44.660
You're telling us this now?!

00:08:46.240 --> 00:08:48.160
Kasel? Everyone?

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:50.080
Are you okay, Princess?

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:51.660
Humans no longer coming.

00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:53.080
You're safe now.

00:08:53.080 --> 00:08:54.140
Princess.

00:08:54.140 --> 00:08:55.160
Forest is safe.

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:57.080
No fear of contamination.

00:08:57.080 --> 00:09:00.830
Princess. We're glad.

00:08:57.080 --> 00:08:59.120
You...

00:08:59.120 --> 00:09:00.830
Open the way.

00:09:00.830 --> 00:09:02.200
Princess.

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:05.040
Are you defying my order?

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:05.040
Princess.

00:09:11.330 --> 00:09:15.200
I know you don't want to trust the humans.

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:16.450
Neither do I...

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:22.450
But Master Lorraine wishes it.

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:30.990
We're sorry to bother you.

00:09:30.990 --> 00:09:33.120
Please, could you let us through?

00:09:38.450 --> 00:09:41.120
Fine, then I'll burn this whole place down!

00:09:41.120 --> 00:09:42.700
Definitely not.

00:09:42.700 --> 00:09:44.660
I'm obviously kidding.

00:09:53.540 --> 00:09:55.120
Oh, so cute!

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:56.950
Is it a baby treant?

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:04.330
Is it guiding us?

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:10.240
Weren't you listening?
Elves and treants make travelers get lost.

00:10:10.240 --> 00:10:14.080
But we can't just stand around.
Let's see where he'll take us.

00:10:21.490 --> 00:10:23.040
Necha!

00:10:23.040 --> 00:10:25.740
You startled me. What is it?

00:10:27.040 --> 00:10:28.320
You...?!

00:10:28.950 --> 00:10:32.080
The little one brought us here.

00:10:32.080 --> 00:10:33.330
Necha did that?

00:10:33.330 --> 00:10:38.370
Necha is his name? But since it's cuter,
can I just call him Chibi?

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:43.580
Weren't you playing in your usual place?

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:50.830
You guided them, thank you. But...

00:10:53.490 --> 00:10:57.160
You can't stay around them.
Humans are dangerous.

00:11:05.200 --> 00:11:07.370
Chibi! Chibi!

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:10.080
Chibi sure has a cute face.

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:12.990
If you do anything bad to Necha,
you will be punished.

00:11:12.990 --> 00:11:14.740
I won't, sheesh.

00:11:14.740 --> 00:11:16.700
It's getting darker.

00:11:16.700 --> 00:11:20.120
Yeah, I'm starting to get hungry.

00:11:20.120 --> 00:11:23.950
I'm sorry, I don't have any more smoked spiders.

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:25.660
I should have saved some for you.

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:28.080
Um, no thanks, sir.

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:31.660
Let's rest here for tonight
and prepare for tomorrow.

00:11:38.620 --> 00:11:42.830
I couldn't figure out which ones were edible,
so I just grabbed them all.

00:11:43.660 --> 00:11:45.160
This one is edible.

00:11:46.410 --> 00:11:48.580
That one's totally poisonous!

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:49.700
It is not.

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:53.290
The color, the patterns,
it's obviously completely deadly.

00:11:54.450 --> 00:11:56.540
You don't have to trust me
if you don't want to.

00:11:57.620 --> 00:11:59.040
Thank you for the food!

00:11:59.040 --> 00:12:00.290
--What?!
--Seriously?!
--Kasel!

00:12:00.290 --> 00:12:02.580
Don't you at least want to cook it first?

00:12:02.580 --> 00:12:04.950
He picked the nastiest looking one first...

00:12:02.580 --> 00:12:04.950
Yes! Delicious!

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:07.410
Delicious? Seriously?

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:07.410
It's okay.

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:17.580
Good, you're getting it!

00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:19.540
Yes! Stronger!

00:12:19.540 --> 00:12:21.490
They're getting along quite well.

00:12:21.490 --> 00:12:23.540
So Kasel has a student now.

00:12:23.540 --> 00:12:26.120
Maybe the student has more potential.

00:12:27.330 --> 00:12:29.950
Kasel, he's beating you.

00:12:29.950 --> 00:12:33.200
Impressive, Chibi. Let me rest a little.

00:12:34.870 --> 00:12:38.160
All right, my turn next!

00:12:39.660 --> 00:12:41.990
You can't handle this.

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:45.080
I don't know unless I try!

00:12:45.080 --> 00:12:46.740
Do you even know how to use a sword?

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:48.580
He has grown fond of you.

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:49.740
Huh?

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:57.040
Perhaps Necha sees something
completely different in you...

00:12:59.200 --> 00:13:04.540
Something only he sees, that we cannot see...

00:13:10.540 --> 00:13:13.410
Who are you?

00:13:20.870 --> 00:13:24.370
Nobody. I'm a nobody.

00:13:24.370 --> 00:13:29.790
I want to protect the people dear to me,
but I have no strength at all.

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:36.790
That's why I have to meet
Master Lorraine, to gain that power.

00:13:45.870 --> 00:13:51.700
The son of King Kyle...
Can he inherit the Holy Sword?

00:13:55.080 --> 00:13:58.080
I'm going to take a look around.

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:04.830
No more swords!

00:14:04.830 --> 00:14:07.580
I think the staff suits you better.

00:14:07.580 --> 00:14:12.040
Yeah, sorcerers use staves.

00:14:12.040 --> 00:14:14.080
Kasel is like, totally a sword guy.

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:15.790
What are you talking about?

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:17.740
You know, like...

00:14:17.740 --> 00:14:21.330
Maybe he was born to wield the Holy Sword.

00:14:22.490 --> 00:14:24.700
It's hard to explain, but...

00:14:24.700 --> 00:14:30.540
The only time a Holy Sword appeared
in history was the one time with King Kyle.

00:14:30.540 --> 00:14:33.830
At least there are no other
documented instances.

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:35.330
Of course.

00:14:35.330 --> 00:14:40.240
Dominix also said, Lua the goddess
gave the Holy Sword to King Kyle.

00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:44.120
Yes. King Kyle was chosen by Lua.

00:14:44.120 --> 00:14:47.370
If Kasel really is the heir,

00:14:47.370 --> 00:14:51.040
then he was destined to do so
from the day he was born.

00:14:51.040 --> 00:14:54.120
Don't you think that's a big difference?

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:58.490
I guess... I don't know.

00:14:58.490 --> 00:14:59.950
There's not much difference.

00:14:59.950 --> 00:15:02.910
Really? I think there is.

00:15:02.910 --> 00:15:05.450
Sorcerers can be so roundabout.

00:15:05.450 --> 00:15:09.700
At the end of the day, you're going
to use the Holy Sword to fight, that's all.

00:15:09.700 --> 00:15:11.830
Yeah, I guess so...

00:15:11.830 --> 00:15:15.870
Come on, you're oversimplifying.

00:15:15.870 --> 00:15:18.620
Hesitation is dangerous during a fight.

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:21.740
You can't fight while
second guessing everything.

00:15:21.740 --> 00:15:24.120
That's why you have to think simple.

00:15:24.120 --> 00:15:28.950
Thinking about what you're doing
is important, I think.

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:33.120
King Kyle, the Holy Sword...

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:35.540
There are so many things I don't understand.

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:38.370
But I want to protect everyone.

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:41.330
And that's why I want power.

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:44.240
I guess that's about right.

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:46.200
But power, huh?

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:49.080
I wonder what power the Holy Sword has.

00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:55.080
What I was taught in church was that it has
the power to defeat even the Dark Lord.

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:58.240
That's basically saying
you don't know anything.

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:00.700
I guess.

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:08.040
A sword that can supposedly combat
the Dark Lord, an exceptionally strong Demon.

00:16:08.040 --> 00:16:13.740
But what if the user was just
an ordinary human? How will he fight then?

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:16.870
I mean, if he died,
wouldn't that be the end of it all?

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:18.160
True.

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:22.160
He's so... ordinary!

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:23.700
True.

00:16:24.990 --> 00:16:28.240
He might not seem that way, but he does
look a bit more impressive than before.

00:16:28.240 --> 00:16:29.870
Nice backup!

00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:35.540
Whatever the case,
our goal is to get to the Holy Sword.

00:16:35.540 --> 00:16:37.830
No matter how ordinary Kasel is.

00:16:37.830 --> 00:16:41.370
Also, there's no guarantee that
the Dark Lord is coming back.

00:16:41.370 --> 00:16:44.160
Doesn't someone need
to bring back the Dark Lord?

00:16:44.160 --> 00:16:47.910
If the sorcerer Malduk is alive, yeah.

00:16:47.910 --> 00:16:52.370
It makes sense to act assuming the worst.

00:16:52.370 --> 00:16:54.580
That the Dark Lord is coming back.

00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:59.290
Angmund, the Dark Lord...

00:16:59.290 --> 00:17:02.790
He, too, has only appeared in history once.

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:03.950
Really?

00:17:03.950 --> 00:17:07.410
Yes. Just once, in King Kyle's era.

00:17:07.410 --> 00:17:13.290
And only King Kyle and his companions
were able to confirm it when they fought.

00:17:13.290 --> 00:17:15.290
Do you know what that means?

00:17:15.290 --> 00:17:16.830
What do you mean?

00:17:16.830 --> 00:17:18.100
It means they made it in time.

00:17:18.990 --> 00:17:23.080
The heroes... King Kyle and
his companions, 100 years ago,

00:17:23.080 --> 00:17:25.450
defeated the Dark Lord
before he came into our world.

00:17:25.450 --> 00:17:26.660
Oh...

00:17:26.660 --> 00:17:32.330
Whatever happened 100 years ago, what we
need to do now is to help Kasel get that sword.

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:33.580
Right.

00:17:33.580 --> 00:17:37.490
Let's grab it quick before
the Dark Lord comes back.

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:38.990
Yeah.

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:40.240
Yes.

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:45.580
Humans are evil creatures.

00:17:47.490 --> 00:17:48.740
But...

00:17:50.660 --> 00:17:54.490
Kasel... There's something about him.

00:17:57.700 --> 00:17:59.080
What?!

00:18:03.540 --> 00:18:05.870
Is everyone all right?!

00:18:05.870 --> 00:18:08.410
Yes. What was that?

00:18:34.410 --> 00:18:35.490
Watch out!

00:18:37.700 --> 00:18:40.200
Treants are supposed to be peaceful, why...?

00:18:47.490 --> 00:18:48.830
This way!

00:18:54.740 --> 00:18:55.950
This...

00:18:59.160 --> 00:19:01.450
Ew, gross...

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:04.870
Disgusting Demon, leave this forest!

00:19:23.830 --> 00:19:24.870
No! Stop!

00:19:31.450 --> 00:19:31.980
Chibi!

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:33.290
Let him go!

00:19:34.120 --> 00:19:35.540
Watch out!

00:19:35.540 --> 00:19:36.360
Are you okay?

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:38.370
I am... but...

00:19:38.370 --> 00:19:41.700
That thing... If I could use
my fire magic, I can easily...

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:44.160
But it'll also hurt Chibi...

00:19:48.450 --> 00:19:49.540
Kasel!

00:19:55.830 --> 00:19:57.040
Miss Selene!

00:19:57.040 --> 00:20:00.740
Escape now! This does not concern you!

00:20:00.740 --> 00:20:03.120
I can't leave Chibi behind!

00:20:04.120 --> 00:20:05.790
He's right!

00:20:05.790 --> 00:20:06.990
I'll get Chibi!

00:20:12.370 --> 00:20:13.950
I can't get any closer like this!

00:20:29.990 --> 00:20:31.120
Frey!

00:20:32.120 --> 00:20:33.290
Kasel!

00:20:54.330 --> 00:20:55.330
Kasel!

00:21:04.660 --> 00:21:05.950
Huh?

00:21:21.620 --> 00:21:23.120
You...

00:21:26.910 --> 00:21:29.200
You! You!

00:21:29.200 --> 00:21:32.080
You!

00:21:39.580 --> 00:21:41.830
Kasel...

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:53.080
This! This thing!

00:21:48.740 --> 00:21:50.160
Kasel... Please stop...

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:51.870
Kasel... Please stop...

00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:53.080
Kasel!

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:54.370
